{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項新的獨立研究報告顯示，在模擬場景中，先進人工智能模型經常將平民、救護車、投降士兵以及伊朗的一所學校誤判為軍事目標。Anthropic PBC的模型表現最差，OpenAI的模型則屬於表現最好的一類，但仍然會出現錯誤。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586850.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T23:22:20.440569+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T22:59:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T23:15:31.942444+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T23:15:31.942444+00:00","content_hash":"3aa225b503f9e1209ba0d8e5c49bae7ecb3ac5ba8c9316c89496268882c9db64","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}